+<!doctype html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+ <meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
+ <meta name="color-scheme" content="light"><title>Agiparel · Document Intelligence</title>
+ <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/documents.css"><script src="/static/documents.js" defer></script>
+</head>
+<body>
+<header class="nav"><a href="/" class="logo"><b>agiparel</b><small>FACTORY OS</small></a><nav><a href="/documents" aria-current="page">Documents</a><a href="/order-intake">Order intake</a><a href="/material-planning">Material planning</a><a href="/planning">Factory planning</a></nav><span class="env">DEVELOPMENT · RESTRICTED</span></header>
+<main>
+ <div class="intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">GATE 06.5 · UNIVERSAL DOCUMENT INTAKE</p><h1>Your source files.<br><span>One connected evidence library.</span></h1><p class="subtitle">Bring the documents your customer already sends. Agiparel retains each original, records its SHA-256 identity, extracts what it can, and exposes precisely what still needs verification. No CSV preparation required.</p></div><div class="roundel">SOURCE<br>FIRST<span>06.5</span></div></div>
+ <section class="guard" aria-label="Evidence limitations"><strong>EVIDENCE ONLY · NO PRODUCTION WRITE</strong><span>Extracted text is not an approved purchase order, BOM or production instruction. Complex relations, scanned pages and ambiguous values remain review work. The Order Intake and Material Planning release gates are unchanged.</span></section>
+ <div class="workflow"><span><b>01</b> Original upload</span><span><b>02</b> Source fingerprints</span><span><b>03</b> Text + sheet/page anchors</span><span><b>04</b> Review before normalization</span></div>
+ <div class="layout">
+ <section class="panel upload"><div class="kicker">A / SOURCE INGESTION</div><h2>Drop your customer files</h2><p>PDFs, Excel, Word, CSV, text and image files. Up to 20 MiB per document. Uploads are kept separate from operational records.</p>
+  <div class="drop" id="drop" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Select documents for upload"><span class="drop-icon">⇧</span><b>Drag files here</b><span>or choose files from your computer</span><input id="files" type="file" multiple aria-label="Choose original customer files"><small>Google Docs / Sheets: download or export an original copy for now. Direct cloud connection is planned for Gate 06.5-B.</small></div>
+  <div class="selection" id="selection" aria-live="polite">No files selected</div>
+  <button class="primary" id="upload" disabled>Upload originals &amp; extract evidence <span>↗</span></button>
+  <div id="feedback" class="feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite">Select your documents to begin.</div>
+  <div class="format-list"><h3>Extraction coverage in this release</h3><div><span>PDF with embedded text</span><b>Text / page</b></div><div><span>Excel .xlsx / Word .docx</span><b>Cells / paragraphs</b></div><div><span>CSV / TSV / TXT</span><b>Rows / lines</b></div><div><span>Scanned PDF / photos</span><em>OCR pending</em></div><div><span>Legacy Excel .xls / Google links</span><em>Converter / connector pending</em></div></div>
+ </section>
+ <section class="panel library"><div class="panel-head"><div><div class="kicker">B / PER-TENANT LIBRARY</div><h2>Document evidence</h2><p>Durable across service restarts · duplicates reuse the source hash</p></div><button class="secondary" id="refresh">Refresh</button></div>
+  <div class="metric-row"><div><span>Source files</span><strong id="total">—</strong></div><div><span>With extracted text</span><strong id="processed">—</strong></div><div><span>Require more work</span><strong id="attention">—</strong></div></div>
+  <div id="doc-list" class="doc-list" aria-live="polite">Loading document library…</div>
+ </section>
+ </div>
+ <section class="panel inspector"><div class="panel-head"><div><div class="kicker">C / SOURCE-ANCHORED INSPECTION</div><h2 id="inspect-title">Select a source to examine</h2><p id="inspect-desc">Every evidence snippet has an extracted page, sheet/row or paragraph locator. Review is still required before mapping facts into order tables.</p></div><a id="download-source" class="secondary" hidden>Download original ↓</a></div>
+  <div class="provenance"><div>SHA-256 FINGERPRINT<strong id="inspect-sha">—</strong></div><div>READINESS / AUTHORITY<strong id="inspect-readiness">NOT AUTHORITATIVE</strong></div></div>
+  <label class="search-label">Search within extracted evidence<input type="search" id="search" placeholder="Search PO, style, size, fabric, UPC, packing…" disabled></label>
+  <p id="evidence-message" class="evidence-message">Choose a document to see its extracted segments.</p>
+  <div id="segments" class="segments" aria-live="polite"></div>
+ </section>
+ <footer>Agiparel Factory OS · CyberinQ · Source-captured is not source-verified. Later gates connect reviewed facts to canonical orders and material calculations.</footer>
+</main>
+</body>
+</html>
